    "detailed_description": "Gridlock Gladiators is an intense action game that combines the planning and tactics of a card battler with the movement and physics of a traditional fighting game. Battle with friends locally, challenge fighters from afar online, or hone your skills against battle hardened Gladiators while collecting new abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid Based Combat</h2><br>Build up damage by inventing new combos on the fly! The higher the damage meter, the more damage your opponent will deal to their barrier when hit into it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/e9742885927dcf228eb099074cebe52d.poster.avif?t=1693780028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/e9742885927dcf228eb099074cebe52d.webm?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/e9742885927dcf228eb099074cebe52d.mp4?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Once the enemy's barrier is weak, use a strong attack to score and explosive KO!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/7e7913346740911e8a2435c2070d67d8.poster.avif?t=1693780028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/7e7913346740911e8a2435c2070d67d8.webm?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/7e7913346740911e8a2435c2070d67d8.mp4?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Creation</h2><br>Collect new pieces of armor, abilities and other accessories from battle and use them to create a character that fits your style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/838f8bead94f170943d8d8787007a039.avif?t=1693780028\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combo Expression</h2><br>Combine abilities collected from different fighters to invent new combos .<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/87a6db161134d190ee7ed5e184394341.poster.avif?t=1693780028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/87a6db161134d190ee7ed5e184394341.webm?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/87a6db161134d190ee7ed5e184394341.mp4?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Gridlock Gladiators is an intense action game that combines the planning and tactics of a card battler with the movement and physics of a traditional fighting game. Battle with friends locally, challenge fighters from afar online, or hone your skills against battle hardened Gladiators while collecting new abilities.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid Based Combat</h2><br>Build up damage by inventing new combos on the fly! The higher the damage meter, the more damage your opponent will deal to their barrier when hit into it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/e9742885927dcf228eb099074cebe52d.poster.avif?t=1693780028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/e9742885927dcf228eb099074cebe52d.webm?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/e9742885927dcf228eb099074cebe52d.mp4?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Once the enemy's barrier is weak, use a strong attack to score and explosive KO!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/7e7913346740911e8a2435c2070d67d8.poster.avif?t=1693780028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/7e7913346740911e8a2435c2070d67d8.webm?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/7e7913346740911e8a2435c2070d67d8.mp4?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Creation</h2><br>Collect new pieces of armor, abilities and other accessories from battle and use them to create a character that fits your style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/838f8bead94f170943d8d8787007a039.avif?t=1693780028\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combo Expression</h2><br>Combine abilities collected from different fighters to invent new combos .<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/87a6db161134d190ee7ed5e184394341.poster.avif?t=1693780028\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/87a6db161134d190ee7ed5e184394341.webm?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564020/extras/87a6db161134d190ee7ed5e184394341.mp4?t=1693780028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "A real-time fast paced fighting game with deck building. Create your own unique characters, fight to collect new abilities and armor, and perform flashy combos to smash your opponent out of the ring in grid based combat!",
